<title>RUSSIA: Russian Central Bank sells 259.3 mln rbls of bonds.</title>
<headline>Russian Central Bank sells 259.3 mln rbls of bonds.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Russia sold 259.30 million roubles ($45,000) nominal of VSM railway bonds on behalf of the company on Friday, the bank's open-market operations department said.</p>
<p>The bank made the following transactions:</p>
<p>    Issue number			Nominal value</p>
<p>Sold:</p>
<p>    22VSM03305			  259.3 million roubles</p>
<p>The bank did not say at what price the paper was sold. The 22VSM03305 issue closed on Friday at 98.06 percent.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520 $=5,760 roubles</p>
</text>
